## Blender, 6: the CoSy logo in 3D. C, o, S and y are round tubes,
## toothpaste style, melted together where they touch, glossy magenta on
## yellow, turned once round; the video loops. Each letter is its center
## line, an array of points traced from the logo and placed in meters by
## X_eTaL (CosyLogo.xtl); Blender gives each line a round tube and round
## ends, fuses them into one mesh and renders it with Cycles.
## Link: https://cosy.com CoSy
## Link: https://github.com/softwarewrighter/reva-fork reva-fork
## Run: just demo blender cosy   (several minutes: 120 frames in Cycles)

"bl:" u_se< "Blender"
"bp:" u_se< "Bpy"
"cy:" u_se< "CosyLogo"

script := ((1280, 720, 120, 0.012, 32) cy:s_cene 0) c_at bp:v_ideo "cosy.mp4"
n := "work/cosy/run.py" bl:w_rite! bp:launcher
n := "work/cosy/scene.py" bl:w_rite! script
"rendering 120 frames with Blender (Cycles) ..."
r := "work/cosy/run.py" bl:r_un! "work/cosy/scene.py work/cosy/out"
"the run, and the error lines in Blender's log:"
lines := (n_ot r = f_irst "\n") p_artition r
d_isclose 1 s_elect lines
d_isclose 2 s_elect lines
"what Blender made:"
bl:r_ead "work/cosy/out/report.txt"
"the files (bytes, path):"
bl:f_iles "work/cosy/out"
